	// resulting NaN dies in GLSL's NaN-hostile clamp/compares (density 0).
	// WGSL's min/max SWALLOW NaN \u2014 saturate(NaN) becomes 1.0, a full-density
	// phantom cloud \u2014 so the "no coverage, no cloud" outcome is made
